+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` (from `src/index.ts`) implements RFC 6902. It applies a JSON Patch, an
+array of the six operations `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy` and `test`, to a JSON document,
